      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Cardiological Society of India. Published by Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Through this case, we want to highlight, that in patients with mucopolysaccharoidosis (MPS), coronary arteries need to be screened in patients with LV dysfunction. Further, CT scan may not be a good modality and newer diagnostic modalities like IVUS must be offered to delineate concentric obstruction. Also, meticulous screening for hypertension must be carried out in all MPS patients."
      },
